      "necessity": "Original XMS policy remains but raw host-pointer copy is replaced with guest-memory access. xmsMoveBlock uses a 12-byte descriptor below SS:BP and forward-copy; xmsMoveMemory must retain overlap-safe SubAlloc relocation. Adapter requests session cancellation on memory failure; that is not itself proof of original AX/BL error delivery or cancellation ordering.",
